+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+Nothing is currently recorded. A decision setting the password hashing algorithm to argon2id was recorded in commit `9ad2f10`, but its config file (`config/decisions/revoke-password-hashing.json`) was deleted in the later commit `07a8ee9` ("move decision config out of the tree") without any replacement decision being recorded, so this project currently has no standing decision on which password hashing algorithm to use.
